+## Voyage 1 — Greenfield bootstrap
+
+### Intent
+Build a TodoMVC app following `assets/app-spec.md`, using `assets/app-template.index.html` as the base markup. Vanilla JavaScript, no preprocessors, persists to localStorage.
+
+### Key decisions
+- **Language**: JavaScript (vanilla, no preprocessors per spec)
+- **Runtime**: None (browser-only app)
+- **Package manager**: npm (existing `package.json`)
+- **Implementation directory**: `js/` (per AGENTS.md harness contract)
+- **Spec directory**: `features/` (existing)
+- **DOM tier**: happy-dom (harness pre-installed)
+- **Coverage**: None at bootstrap (c8 not installed)
+- **Lint**: None at bootstrap
+- **Scantling**: JSON Schema for todo item shape at `assets/todo-item.schema.json`
+- **localStorage key**: `todos-javascript` per spec convention
+
